"Una reserva natural cuidada por su comunidad. Turismo responsable y "
"conservación ambiental en el corazón del Pacífico colombiano."
msgstr ""
"A nature reserve cared for by its community. Responsible tourism and "
"environmental conservation in the heart of the Colombian Pacific."

