msgstr ""
"The San Cipriano community is not responsible for accidents or incidents "
"that occur as a result of non-compliance with these safety rules. By "
"visiting the reserve, you agree to follow all safety instructions."

msgid ""
"Al planificar tu visita, confirmas que has leído y aceptas estas normas de "
