"reserva, cerca de la estación de brujitas. Día y noche se cobran por "
"separado."
msgstr ""
"Safe, guarded parking for your vehicle at the reserve entrance, near the "
"brujita station. Day and night are charged separately."

msgid "Estamos aquí para ayudarte a planificar tu visita a San Cipriano."
msgstr "We are here to help you plan your visit to San Cipriano."

msgid ""
"Estas aguas cristalinas son el tesoro de nuestra comunidad. Ayúdanos a "
"mantenerlas puras."
msgstr ""
"These crystal-clear waters are our community's treasure. Help us keep them "
"pure."

