"La reserva es hogar de ranas venenosas de colores y especies únicas del "
"Chocó biogeográfico. Obsérvalas sin tocarlas."
msgstr ""
"The reserve is home to colorful poison frogs and unique species of the Chocó"
" biogeographic region. Observe them without touching them."

msgid ""
