" de los palenques, comunidades de africanos esclavizados que escaparon y "
"formaron asentamientos libres en las selvas del Pacífico colombiano."
msgstr ""
"San Cipriano is an Afro-descendant community with deep roots in Colombian "
"history. Our ancestors arrived in these lands as part of the palenques, "
"communities of enslaved Africans who escaped and formed free settlements in "
"the rainforests of the Colombian Pacific."

msgid ""
"San Cipriano es una comunidad afrodescendiente heredera de los palenques. "
"Conversa con su gente y conoce cómo cuidan la reserva."
msgstr ""
"San Cipriano is an Afro-descendant community, heir to the palenques. Talk "
"with its people and learn how they take care of the reserve."

